bin/
!**/src/main/**/bin/
!**/src/test/**/bin/
# The eval plugin's CLI shim is SOURCE, not a build output. `bin/` swallowed it
# silently: the commit that introduced it went through without it, so the
# committed recipe would have pointed every operator at a directory that is not
# there, and the run would have graded whichever tla-spec-dev they happened to
# have installed -- which is the exact defect the shim exists to prevent,
# restored by the ignore file.
!examples/agent_integration/eval-plugin/bin/
!examples/agent_integration/eval-plugin/bin/**

